- Teach us again, okay?

239
00:17:47,962 --> 00:17:49,005
Thank you!

240
00:17:49,089 --> 00:17:52,509
No-No problem thank you
for coming! Th-Thank you!

241
00:17:54,385 --> 00:17:57,472
Sadako! For someone who
struggles with this stuff, you did great!

242
00:17:57,555 --> 00:18:00,642
Master, thanks for everything today!

243
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:09,943
I wouldn't, I don't think I
would turn her down if she asked me.

244
00:18:10,985 --> 00:18:11,903
"Wood ant"?

245
00:18:19,994 --> 00:18:24,290
- Sorry, mind heading home without me?
- Huh?

246
00:18:24,374 --> 00:18:28,795
I got some business to take
care of. It's kind of important.

247
00:18:31,631 --> 00:18:32,257
Kuronuma.

248
00:18:34,050 --> 00:18:35,301
Do you have a sec?

249
00:18:36,553 --> 00:18:38,888
So, Sawako, we gotta head out now.

250
00:18:40,974 --> 00:18:45,812
Remember? You said you wanted to
check out some dresses together?

251
00:18:45,895 --> 00:18:50,733
Oh, yeah, that's right! We
should get going then, see ya Sawako!

252
00:19:06,541 --> 00:19:12,755
Today I'm going to try... to be warmer...
I'll start with a friendly thank you.

253
00:19:12,839 --> 00:19:14,215
- So...
- U-Um...

254
00:19:16,801 --> 00:19:19,470
- I interrupted him!
- All good. You go first.

255
00:19:19,554 --> 00:19:22,056
Y-you sure? I'm so sorry about that.

256
00:19:23,183 --> 00:19:24,809
I-I just want to say...

257
00:19:28,146 --> 00:19:31,024
I a-appreciate what you did for me today.

258
00:19:33,985 --> 00:19:37,655
I meant for that to be way more natural...
but I'm not good at this. Even though I

259
00:19:37,739 --> 00:19:39,365
was so happy...

260
00:19:44,454 --> 00:19:47,790
I... I don't think I'm very good at...
speaking in front of people, but still,

261
00:19:47,874 --> 00:19:50,585
- I--
- I think you are.

262
00:19:54,297 --> 00:19:58,885
Teaching other people like that...
I think you're really good at it.

263
00:20:04,307 --> 00:20:08,561
I... don't want to do
anything to make Kazehaya hate me.

264
00:20:20,865 --> 00:20:24,744
Remember... what I told you before?

265
00:20:28,790 --> 00:20:31,459
You don't need to worry about it, 'kay?

266
00:20:34,504 --> 00:20:35,838
Forget what I said.

267
00:21:03,825 --> 00:21:04,659
Yo.

268
00:21:12,083 --> 00:21:13,626
I was waiting for you.

269
00:22:27,116 --> 00:22:29,869
I'm subconsciously self-conscious...

270
00:22:30,703 --> 00:22:35,583
The more I take action, the
more... Next time: "Misunderstood"
